# ================================================================
# PATIENT-LEVEL IMAGE CLASSIFICATION ANALYSIS
#
# Hirschsprung Disease — Ganglion Cell Detection
#
# PURPOSE:
# Evaluate how accurately each model distinguishes
# ganglion-positive and ganglion-negative images
# WITHIN EACH PATIENT.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# This is NOT specimen-level presence/absence classification.
# This is NOT clinical HD diagnosis classification.
#
# DATA:
# HKL Validation
# UMMC External Test
#
# THRESHOLD:
# Fixed confidence threshold = 0.50
#
# NO RETRAINING REQUIRED
# ================================================================

